# Live files

App root: `Production Design Queue Manager/`.

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `queue_app.py` | Live GUI entry |
| `run_auto_missing_logo.bat` / `scripts/auto_missing_logo_watcher.py` | Shared Inbox Missing Logo auto-run |
| `config/queue_app_settings.json` | Design folder paths for GUI + auto-run |
| `config/Configuration Workbook.xlsx` | Pocket / Override Print Size (Size References sheet archive for sizing) |
| `../Custom Label Database/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Print sizes (Width/Height mm) via universal SKU match |
| `../Shared Inbox/DTF Des/` | Inbox → Processed / Failed |
| `Output/`, `Logs/`, `Missing Size Reference/` | Outputs |

Do not use CL `support/Size References.csv` as this app’s live size table.
